      "writtenOn": "2023-12-04T18:35:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No cast is done on this type. \n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003dtSMP_EVT\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main%20f:packages%2Fmodules%2FBluetooth\n\nOne occasion I had is, I want to group similar values together, but because of unnecessary value assignment, I have to append new values.\n\nThat\u0027s why I prefer not assigning values unless it is some value defined by the spec.",
      "parentUuid": "0101c049_46bf4fc8",
      "revId": "b1306d7a14928bc0e5d94a79d6b2419ddd08094b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
